{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747915178187817123","content":"As the ferry departs from the harbor and the city fades behind you, a small old woman clambers up from the worker's area and grins to the passengers. She appears to be the old lady who collected your tickets, but that woman definitely had brown hair and you could have sworn she waved you off from the shore. You shrug it off. Probably just your eyes playing tricks on you, or maybe you misremembered.\n\"Now dearies, before we arrive at Ferrytown, there are some things ye best know.\" Her voice is old and creaky, and she has an accent both distinctive and unfamiliar. \"I'm sure some of ye have heard the stories about strange creatures and mysterious happenings, but I can excitedly confirm that they are in fact, all true!\" She pauses for a minute, observing the shock on your faces before breaking out into raucous laughter. \n\"I'm joking, of course! Would hardly be able to have visitors if Feyrrytown was everything the stories said we are.\" You notice that she seems to add in an extra y to the name this time. \"Course, it ain't perfectly safe. No place is, these days. But ye stay in the main areas and don't wander into the wilder areas of our little district and ye should do just fine.\" The ferry begins to approach its destination, slowing down. \n\"One last thing, dearies.\" She says with a grin. \"In Ferrytown, if someone asks you 'can I have your name?', the polite response is 'no, but you can call me...'\" Each person riding the ferry sees her wink at specifically them, before she ducks back to the underbelly from whence she came. \nWhen you finally step off into the town, you can see her already on shore, boarding passengers for the return trip. Her hair is blonde, rather than grey or brown, and she appears to be in the midst of a conversation that has been going on for quite some time. You shake off the strange feeling and wander off into the metropolis.","created_at":"2020-08-30T18:53:56.159000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"749703470394638458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
