{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747915178187817123","content":"And I'm not sure how to use this line but I think it makes sense for something the players are told at one point.\n\"Now, most of the creatures that steal your name are relatively benign. You're most likely to find it stuffed into your shoe along with a bunch of beard soap (precursor to shaving cream). It'll be hell to clean, but ya shouldn't go without a name for more than a day. They tend to take names for the rush of doin' it. Some of 'em might just make ya grovel for a bit. In public, o' course.\" He grins and takes another puff of his pipe. \"But that's all old news to ya, I'm sure. What can uncle paddy do for ya today?\"","created_at":"2020-08-30T19:06:01.855000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-30T19:06:26.613000Z","id":"749706514184273990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
